<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Oct inflation yr/yr at 4.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippine Oct inflation yr/yr at 4.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine inflation rate in October rose to 4.7 percent year-on-year from September's 4.4 percent, the National Statistics Office said on Tuesday (NSO).  </p>
<p>This brings the ten-month average inflation to 9.1 percent from 9.7 percent in the year-earlier period, the agency said.</p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES	   Oct 96   Sept 96   Oct 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change    -0.1	-0.2	-0.3</p>
<p>    Yr-on-yr change	    +4.7	+4.4     +11.0</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1988)   230.0     230.2     219.7</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937 Fax 817-6267</p>
